# Context of apps/web/Dockerfile (repo root). apps/api/Dockerfile has its own: apps/api/Dockerfile.dockerignore.
.git
.claude
.superpowers
**/.env*
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/api
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/playwright-report
docs
infra
# Web image reads only the trainer statements (tasks/NN-slug.mdx). Hidden trainer cases (.yaml) and
# everything in a code review task folder (tasks/<slug>/**: the statement comes from the API) stay out.
# A trailing slash is cleaned away by Docker, so `tasks/*` also hits flat files: the .mdx are re-included.
content/**/tasks/*
!content/**/tasks/*.mdx
# Simulator tasks are simulator/NN-slug.{yaml,mdx}: the hidden .yaml (targets, review reference, reference graph)
# stays out, the .mdx statements are read by the web server.
content/**/simulator/*
!content/**/simulator/*.mdx
